      "statement": "Frontend error reporting is opt-in at build time via VITE_FRONTEND_ERROR_REPORTING=true (which also selects hidden source maps); when enabled, automatic window.error/unhandledrejection capture installs before the RPC WebSocket opens and reports POST to the same-origin /api/client-errors; otherwise every report call is a no-op.",
