    {
      "id": "claim_dfc262379fd94618991865724c215815",
      "statement": "Frontend reports never convey authority: reportedUserId is an unverified client-supplied diagnostic label (never read to make a decision), and pageLocation is rebuilt by normalizePageLocation to origin+pathname only so credentials, query, and fragment (notably the #share= bearer capability) never leave the tab, with non-http(s) locations like blob: or about:srcdoc dropped.",
