    {
      "id": "claim_613e9f3e62f84bf28c4e01c7883351bd",
      "statement": "The /api/client-errors endpoint is deliberately a no-op (204) unless both FRONTEND_ERROR_REPORTER and FRONTEND_ERROR_RATE_LIMITER are bound; otherwise it requires POST, same-origin, JSON, a 128 KiB bounded body, and rate limiting keyed by verified CF Access identity or connecting IP with a limiter failure failing closed to 204, then normalizes the report tolerantly and dispatches to the Reporter via waitUntil with host-owned surface/vendor attributes.",
